flowchart TD
    A[Expand tildes, sniff source shape] --> B{Source shape}
    B -- profile path --> C[Evaluate profile, build desired manifest]
    B -- path with cb suffix --> D[Read bundle archive alone]
    B -- at-name or percent-N --> E[Resolve slot, load stored manifest]
    C --> F[Read the fixed slot state]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G[Baseline drift against disk]
    G --> H{Preview wanted}
    H -- profile and slots --> I[Render the preview]
    H -- bundle file --> J[Skip preview]
    I --> K{Force flag}
    J --> K
    K -- set --> L[Take a fresh drift snapshot]
    K -- clear --> M[Prompt for yes]
    M -- other answer --> N[Abort, disk untouched]
    M -- yes --> L
    L --> O{Drift moved}
    O -- yes --> P[Print drift, prompt again]
    O -- steady --> Q[Write desired documents]
    P -- other answer --> N
    P -- yes --> Q
    Q --> R[Delete orphans plus dropped members]
    R --> S[Store the fixed slot]
    S --> T[Archive entry, rotate history]
    T --> U[Prune orphaned pool blobs]
    U --> V[Run hooks by plan order]
    V --> W[Report counts plus archive path]
